+
+## Account settings & passkeys
+
+Signed-in readers can open **Account** (`/devtools-times/account`) to add, rename and remove passkeys.
+Sign-in is proxied through `/api/auth/login` so the reader is stored in the server-side Astro session.
+Passkey records are kept in a JSON file at `.data/passkeys.json` (override with `PASSKEY_STORE_FILE`).
+After passkeys change, the page uses the WebAuthn Signal API (`signalAllAcceptedCredentials`,
+`signalCurrentUserDetails`) to keep the browser's password manager in sync, where the browser supports it.
